{"seq":2,"slug":"wind-simulation","title":"风场模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/wind-simulation","wordCount":1292,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"风场模拟\">风场模拟</h1><p>风是天气里最「看不见却处处可见」的现象：你看不到风本身，只看到草在伏、旗在飘、雨在斜、烟在散。把风做成一个标量风速太弱——那样全场草朝同一方向齐刷刷地倒，假得刺眼。这一篇把风升级为一个随空间与时间变化的矢量场，讲它如何被植被、粒子、降水消费，以及在 2026 年的项目里如何用 GPU 高效地让一整片森林对阵风做出空间各异的响应。风从<a href=\"../foundations/weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a>取基础风速与主风向，向植被、<a href=\"precipitation\">降水</a>、<a href=\"clouds-fog\">云与雾</a>供值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从标量到矢量场\">核心概念：从标量到矢量场</h2><p>风的正确抽象是一个函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{W}(\\vec{x}, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：给定位置与时间，返回一个风矢量。它由几层叠加：一个缓变的<strong>全局风</strong>（来自状态机的主风向与风速）、一个空间起伏的<strong>阵风噪声</strong>（让不同位置风力不同，产生「风吹过草地的波」）、以及局部的<strong>风障与风源</strong>（建筑背风面减弱、引擎喷口、爆炸冲击）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[状态机: 风速/主风向] --&gt; B[全局风矢量]&#10;  C[空间噪声&lt;br/&gt;Perlin/流噪声] --&gt; D[阵风扰动]&#10;  E[局部风源/风障&lt;br/&gt;建筑/爆炸] --&gt; F[局部覆盖]&#10;  B --&gt; G[风场 W x,t]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[植被顶点动画]&#10;  G --&gt; I[粒子/降水平流]&#10;  G --&gt; J[云雾平流]\">flowchart TD\n  A[状态机: 风速/主风向] --&gt; B[全局风矢量]\n  C[空间噪声&lt;br/&gt;Perlin/流噪声] --&gt; D[阵风扰动]\n  E[局部风源/风障&lt;br/&gt;建筑/爆炸] --&gt; F[局部覆盖]\n  B --&gt; G[风场 W x,t]\n  D --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[植被顶点动画]\n  G --&gt; I[粒子/降水平流]\n  G --&gt; J[云雾平流]</pre><p>下表区分风场的三个频段，它们的更新频率与数据规模差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>频段</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>时间尺度</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局风</td>\n<td>状态机主风向/风速</td>\n<td>分钟级缓变</td>\n<td>整体倾向（草往哪倒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阵风</td>\n<td>空间噪声采样</td>\n<td>秒级起伏</td>\n<td>风过草地的波纹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>风源/风障/冲击</td>\n<td>瞬时</td>\n<td>爆炸吹散、背风遮挡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"植被响应-顶点着色器里的风\">植被响应：顶点着色器里的风</h2><p>让一整片草和树对风做出响应，最忌讳的是用物理刚体逐株模拟——那在大规模植被上必然爆开销。2026 年的主流做法仍是在<strong>顶点着色器</strong>里做程序化风动画：每个顶点根据其世界坐标采样风场，按到根部的高度加权偏移，叶尖摆动大、根部不动。这套方法与 GPU 实例化天然契合，一次绘制调用可以让成千上万株草各自响应空间不同的风，开销几乎只取决于像素而非株数。<code>God of War</code> 系列公开过的技术分享展示了空间变化的三维风场如何驱动无骨树木摇摆与角色拨开草丛的交互（GDC Vault，&quot;Interactive Wind and Vegetation in God of War&quot;）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hlsl\" data-code=\"// 顶点着色器：程序化风（简化）&#10;float3 ApplyWind(float3 worldPos, float vertexHeight) {&#10;    float2 w = SampleWindField(worldPos.xz, _Time.y); // 采样风场&#10;    float sway = sin(_Time.y * _Freq + dot(worldPos.xz, _Phase));&#10;    float weight = vertexHeight * vertexHeight;        // 越高摆越大&#10;    return worldPos + float3(w.x, 0, w.y) * sway * weight * _Amplitude;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 顶点着色器：程序化风（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float3 ApplyWind(float3 worldPos, float vertexHeight) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float2 w = SampleWindField(worldPos.xz, _Time.y); // 采样风场</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float sway = sin(_Time.y * _Freq + dot(worldPos.xz, _Phase));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float weight = vertexHeight * vertexHeight;        // 越高摆越大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return worldPos + float3(w.x, 0, w.y) * sway * weight * _Amplitude;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>植被对风的响应属于本 hub 与植被渲染的交界——具体的实例化、LOD、卡片化属于植被/地形渲染管线（见<a href=\"../../game-terrain-systems/\">游戏地形系统</a>的植被散布），本 hub 负责提供那个被采样的风场。更通用的着色器顶点动画技法见<a href=\"../../shader-programming/\">着色器编程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风作为平流源\">风作为平流源</h2><p>风场不只驱动植被，它还是其他现象的「搬运工」。<a href=\"precipitation\">降水</a>的雨雪要按风做平流而倾斜横飞；烟雾、灰尘、落叶等粒子要被风吹散；<a href=\"clouds-fog\">云与雾</a>的体积要随风缓慢平移。这意味着风场是天气现象篇的公共基础设施，三类现象都来采样它。</p>\n<p>平流的数学很简单：一个被风携带的量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>（粒子位置、烟密度）在风场中的输运为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial q}{\\partial t} + \\vec{W}\\cdot\\nabla q = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2772em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，离散到每帧就是把粒子位置按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>←</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{x} \\leftarrow \\vec{x} + \\vec{W}(\\vec{x},t)\\,\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 推进。注意要乘以每种现象的「受风系数」——同样的风，落叶被吹得远、重物纹丝不动、雪比雨飘得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风场的存储与采样\">风场的存储与采样</h2><p>如何存这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{W}(\\vec{x},t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定了它的代价与表现力。最轻量的是<strong>程序化采样</strong>：不存数据，每次查询时现算（全局风 + 噪声函数 + 局部源叠加），零内存、可微、易同步，缺点是难表达复杂绕流。更重的是<strong>风场纹理</strong>：把一片区域的风预烘焙或实时写入一张二维/三维纹理，植被着色器直接采样，支持建筑绕流等空间细节，代价是内存与更新带宽。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[查询点 x,t] --&gt; B{风场实现}&#10;  B --&gt;|程序化| C[全局+噪声+局部 现算]&#10;  B --&gt;|纹理| D[采样预烘焙/实时风纹理]&#10;  C --&gt; E[风矢量 W]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[植被/粒子/降水/云雾]\">flowchart TD\n  A[查询点 x,t] --&gt; B{风场实现}\n  B --&gt;|程序化| C[全局+噪声+局部 现算]\n  B --&gt;|纹理| D[采样预烘焙/实时风纹理]\n  C --&gt; E[风矢量 W]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[植被/粒子/降水/云雾]</pre><p>程序化采样对网络同步极友好：只要所有客户端用同一份噪声种子与同一份状态机参数，就能各自算出一致的风场，无需同步任何风数据——这正是确定性天气的一块基石，详见<a href=\"../practice/weather-networking\">天气网络同步</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风的正确抽象是矢量场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{W}(\\vec{x},t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，由全局风 + 阵风噪声 + 局部风源/风障三频段叠加。</li>\n<li>大规模植被响应风用顶点着色器程序化动画 + GPU 实例化，开销与株数几乎无关，避免逐株物理。</li>\n<li>风是公共平流源：降水、粒子、云雾都来采样它做输运，记得乘各自的受风系数。</li>\n<li>风场存储分程序化（零内存、易同步）与纹理（支持绕流细节、代价高）两路。</li>\n<li>程序化风对确定性网络同步极友好：同种子同参数即可各端一致，无需同步风数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>风速与主风向的来源：<a href=\"../foundations/weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a></li>\n<li>被风平流的降水：<a href=\"precipitation\">降水：雨雪</a></li>\n<li>被风平移的体积：<a href=\"clouds-fog\">云与雾</a></li>\n<li>顶点动画与噪声的着色器实现：<a href=\"../../shader-programming/\">着色器编程</a></li>\n<li>植被散布与 LOD：<a href=\"../../game-terrain-systems/\">游戏地形系统</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风场模拟","id":"风场模拟"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从标量到矢量场","id":"核心概念-从标量到矢量场"},{"level":2,"text":"植被响应：顶点着色器里的风","id":"植被响应-顶点着色器里的风"},{"level":2,"text":"风作为平流源","id":"风作为平流源"},{"level":2,"text":"风场的存储与采样","id":"风场的存储与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"降水：雨雪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/precipitation"},"next":{"title":"云与雾","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/clouds-fog"}}